Replace signed left shift of a potentially negative Bark lower-window index
with exact multiplication by 65536. Vorbis block sizes are bounded by 8192;
the long intermediate and packed signed 32-bit window retain their range.
The signed upper-window extraction and low 16-bit upper bound are unchanged.

--- a/thirdparty/libvorbis/psy.c
+++ b/thirdparty/libvorbis/psy.c
@@ -318,4 +318,4 @@

-    p->bark[i]=((lo-1)<<16)+(hi-1);
+    p->bark[i]=(lo-1)*65536+(hi-1);

   }
